problem_statement:
Implement the option to add new instructions at the end of `tasks.test` in the `build.gradle.kts`
### I suggest changing the existing GradleConfiguration API.

from:

```java
.gradleConfigurations()
  .configuration()
.and()
```

to:

```java
.configurations()
  .addConfigurarion("")
  .addTasksTestInstruction("")
.and()
```

### Here is how the changes will affect the existing code:

[At LocalProfileModuleFactory](https://github.com/jhipster/jhipster-lite/blob/main/src/main/java/tech/jhipster/lite/generator/server/springboot/localeprofile/domain/LocalProfileModuleFactory.java#L27-L43)  from:
```java
.gradleConfigurations()
  .configuration(
    """
    tasks.build {
      dependsOn("processResources")
    }

    tasks.processResources {
      filesMatching("**/*.yml") {
        filter { it.replace("@spring.profiles.active@", springProfilesActive) }
      }
      filesMatching("**/*.properties") {
        filter { it.replace("@spring.profiles.active@", springProfilesActive) }
      }
    }
    """
  )
```

to:

```java
.gradleConfigurations()
  .addConfigurarion(
    """
    tasks.build {
      dependsOn("processResources")
    }

    tasks.processResources {
      filesMatching("**/*.yml") {
        filter { it.replace("@spring.profiles.active@", springProfilesActive) }
      }
      filesMatching("**/*.properties") {
        filter { it.replace("@spring.profiles.active@", springProfilesActive) }
      }
    }
    """
  )
```

[At JacocoModuleFactory](https://github.com/jhipster/jhipster-lite/blob/main/src/main/java/tech/jhipster/lite/generator/server/javatool/jacoco/domain/JacocoModuleFactory.java#L79-L82) from:
```java
