  .in(path("build.gradle.kts"))
  .add(EXISTING_BUILD_GRADLE_TASK_TEST_NEEDLE, ADD_JACOCO_BUILD_GRADLE_TASK_TEST)
  .and()
.and()
```

to:
```java
.configurations()
  .addTasksTestInstruction("""finalizedBy("jacocoTestReport")""")
.and()
```
 
The goal of this issue is to [make this possible](https://github.com/renanfranca/sample-frontend-gradle/pull/2/files#diff-c0dfa6bc7a8685217f70a860145fbdf416d449eaff052fa28352c5cec1a98c06L123-L124). Implement the option to add  instructions at the end of `tasks.test` in the `build.gradle.kts`

